# o lists a message's links; a key opens one (shown here without opening).
Output docs/assets/demo/links.gif

Hide
Type "./bin/sltty -demo"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show

Ctrl+K
Sleep 400ms
Type "#tools-team"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "l"
Sleep 500ms
Type "k"
Sleep 500ms
Type "k"
Sleep 500ms
Type "k"
Sleep 500ms
Type "k"
Sleep 500ms
Type "o"
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Sleep 800ms
